{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1544,
  "batch_count": 1662,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "c0513553da490a692523f45b5f779f99f6cb7e34",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e68de30b60133ddab3cafc5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们祈祷所有人都能平安地\r\n结束这场战斗吧。\r\n因为再也没有比这更令人欣慰的事了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54b23730a68a821dd86b472b43cd921899d24d72a3bb6140243548bcca11aef8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71cf3167ed92f28ad92654d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请回顾一下走过的轨迹。\r\n过往的修行无可动摇。\r\n坚信希望，与我共同战斗吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cabe471beafee8b70509911f06c0de869e0ebdd0ca9c035fcdcbb8e5d0382a25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9303ab08e239af3fa68b28d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……好强的邪气……但是……！\r\n心中的阴霾，\r\n我必用神圣之光将其祓除……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "165723d2124d53dd927ff39205bb240904774ecbccaf31b02151ff000ad509d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb87c848314d8ccb4dbdf15d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "苍天啊，您是让我在这场\r\n白日梦中继续前行吗……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d715f2c8eb235049cdda1e6b95cf2d8c4158649e47a5a5a83046c164afa24817",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ffdb178f5a654132b30cc14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我绝不会屈服于戏言……\r\n折磨着我的恶魔低语啊，\r\n退散吧……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "913881ff9988238c45ca020dd2e84ccd22f530ae1c97f527109a594c2b7e2890",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49db3a119efba52656333339",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "失去了精灵的加护，苍天的光辉亦已\r\n隐退。如今正该展现身为圣女的\r\n真正价值……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53061cbdc973899e875e707bbcec83fe3d73b483653daeb7ffb0be81b24a79d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:178fe87394f323c4726b5f41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的意志，绝不会就此被击碎。\r\n我反而要感谢这番困境与试炼，\r\n全力驰骋到底……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "114c5e64acc1175f8c41097a5fba13b73475013077d2c75ec0107f2d7b2663f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5f1b3775358f3877197f8eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黑暗正笼罩着此身……然而，\r\n哪怕仅有一丝玛娜的火光也已足够。\r\n我将毫不迟疑，继续前进……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14607124128467f10936b6607230b88ee2c8c684e85d31754bfe2e0dacc9c46d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fd4bbac0b600f219816e056",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "639ec917f68ca8864ddb2ad4eb800eccca968da99504ad48a5e78de236d94f73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52007d99eba70632b02786f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efe950fbcdb2a89959296051",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请赐予指引。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d1e8de04e9dda74dd5b039272e04d75d88b2acb8b222060bcf9c829020eed5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54854109432d54596289ca04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是研习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db1026f5db25f926b1c1f0ba6d907f682b0c4812201cee912e59b962e91523c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81a8bc9035b280e3c09c293e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎会如此……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7a011901dab6c8bce33ed131001ab950a4522498e3dd417be02378b0da7cbe0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cab43e272731a91041a78bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdba625e48012ccb9ad71877721cc10414ee827e304b5a1a6b72f395d5735f23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa60225bf4670754f9c4f37a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们去巡访吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f069a999fab5852a9ce5129ce8c7facf21c2b8a9a86e6580ef72ca3bfa841565",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc87ede17e9ea2537e3bd5f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是恩赐呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cb825929486c047932d54bb1246ecaf5a9b01c3ef56594ed690869e3317b545",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75aad1773c8a6af65f4a586f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿未来常伴祝福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdaedcd7c43336ff01c98c8107add079fa6d8b45a564db9f553eedc846cd417f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef55a3e379bc27bd4441ea5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我绝不会忘记您的教诲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2df60054e1f676133d2463038688ef79f7a831945a6bec1b14b12d2fefc46988",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4896f04cb5868c87b8c3068",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将祝福献予您——",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7b0a404b38117afd90b2aac4d2e7980cdc18d90b1f08fe49e1da83bfcfd7739",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c777588a406667f988564673",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "由我来施以救赎。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf3f00d9ac6ccffb60c8e959aef24cc40813e8d4e84cccc96c66f0eca90a2273",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5334e401ab49a17a765dcdad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝着崭新的世界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5acddbc10f4831edfaee510df0a3d75935d13135bf8c399856f69f507c7f5db3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37eec753a30ce51192c7d567",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我绝不会忘记您的教诲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2df60054e1f676133d2463038688ef79f7a831945a6bec1b14b12d2fefc46988",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6b6977404b8c9907e009eb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，\r\n请安心见证吧。\r\n我所踏上的这条光辉之途！",
      "source_fingerprint": "060886a85c7688a1c1c4d2a6aaec07abb9dd64eff0ebb4ef963da64eeb91686a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:324faa1cedc0ce45d8f68ad3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，看到了！我看到了！\n那道指引我们通往荣耀的\n命运之光！来吧，让我们同行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d2dbab4fb084408bb8534ba832ba156100686caf62b9db94c170589d96b3bd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a325d619dbb60d33ab67cf22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我绝不会忘记您的教诲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2df60054e1f676133d2463038688ef79f7a831945a6bec1b14b12d2fefc46988",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:227e0dcc33ffbaa5894456e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f80c7f95fa69ef3c8018bcc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次我一定能抵达！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a8da4960f76485c8146a43cc609575902695663d6d7aba343c34eb84bf16614",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:559f6cc7a9c77fdce3f63f37",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须更加勤勉修行才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d8792495014ec161177037e46f1e527b596bfe5cbd8636c71ba29d4acef82bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e99e3cee61b1df6b75eafcac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须投身于更多的试炼中才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "086e88fe99ff8e3c0dc94e3dc45a155323895c33f897c2272e5a05d5b12a0945",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f315b78d7b906754061390e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须坚定信仰才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dfb188669bcab79f7849409f58a982e96088ebf85e940936a3f197330ce3babb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aefb93e749e0f2ebebdb4d08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦，感谢引领我走向胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "740ea4d47555d4319f5d771044d897121e314970b6264ed5af387675299edb01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e680d79c0e48ec3a4c290d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "传达到了呢！神圣的祈祷——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "268f6e1d01af2898de775c8a4c9f24104a43c3781590dca805c257d104229c2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32443ea30d8a3a607c7f2a06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "遵从指引。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37e50131bfe969d9436c9be7cc956961210d0ac903c0d7771725b28e95f1c38c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c639297a92420e6f7b3d7e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿得祝福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9caf664646f7ff0c5d9420c1a4a7c63011407347db3e6f3aad020bb263a188f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5a3f6c8a44d95c5a82f2cab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对被邪恶囚禁的可怜灵魂\r\n施以救赎。赐予神圣祝福……！！\r\n已经，没事了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07f360df88034066b836d9ef593d2ebcc72428c6425fdf53021eacb8cf537b9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aadc94ba0a9c907b8ac06b2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿这歌声，响彻遥远彼方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c54ba5e881a6685c570045c8dbf60daed21fea66d3cc774cb09341892cd9bed9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3892873df4a27a0e748beb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将用恩宠之光，照亮各位。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1166321b4180c2e385570ae84bd1896e80274b51afed6d0fd3f4c4d2f16b206a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0423f5162608388e4c653a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请带我，从这里离开——",
      "source_fingerprint": "446b57faf1e5047bc5b366a4cca7d7b951d54303f5510ce8e732c1dd08598107",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:145de114d42c6b3e32a40cd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "获赐灵光耀眼之匙的圣女，\r\n探寻到了通往异界之路——\r\n我已将其记在《圣女之书》上了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edeeade58618ae793bb76cda887ba47727cff1ef141adbddc8983195534e7c3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c29c0d1d3ee95e3e3186684",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为清正洁身的学生，我将积德行善。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dcd960f991bc1dd102fd39fa007687081bbcf0fa610da346ae1a390623d65bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:422e3be9df9e0e903da1ad5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正是能歌善舞的新时代圣女！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d73c23f9a38771533b7f1b70f75f238be04c5670c2fbc1292816af2e1d5a92d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb5d85677acf09121fe3ad5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身披神圣意志与浩瀚恩泽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "889189408428562662d1bcd35deaad05043ba3860c05df69082ef391b2d6e8c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6aed48bdfeb355d1e1aab21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "裙子上起褶子了……祈祷得太久了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a70e0d302eccc9767c403dd75e293ae3cd0a65f23e369321752b4c927b4f25cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a0286fb0fa8cd519dbf3037",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以曼妙舞步，净化人们的心灵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01f11205a2820f44eb42d9db0483b0124d72cc4029f2d96d689ec43f25732b2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e74516b01e830c7a7cdc3ea2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "束起光芒的纯白缎带……真可爱♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b8e22db97f97408be22ec8165c23ce7ff78098350ded47214e19dd7aad7ab7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1842e0b2fb9dd33a14bf539b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "志愿奉仕活动似乎会变得很有趣呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f358aef3577dc78d7f9e1a91f308865baa5e62af014ec022db9028ba1abe2dcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9378d5332790814c4d46680c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，看来精灵也很中意呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14f8a28fba13d20e69667cbb52324bfc4b0ad12e0e6c036899998129e4c4a51b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8ddafc872dfaa16846bdc4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "熠熠生辉的我……正是天选的圣女。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b2592563af648db1761db3501b50bdf169fbc0bb262c14b1d67bf7468f00954",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d3e7768aa4024a6eaae5de6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去巡礼吧，前往心仪的咖啡馆♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a2795612796f7b1d0879e6a98605f755b59d707131e33eac529f062c08d0da9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:685977ceee2e1b98a9945fc9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为清正洁身的学生，我将积德行善。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dcd960f991bc1dd102fd39fa007687081bbcf0fa610da346ae1a390623d65bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12eca6ed8bde3e2d79301e4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正是能歌善舞的新时代圣女！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d73c23f9a38771533b7f1b70f75f238be04c5670c2fbc1292816af2e1d5a92d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c28c8e098ddb799a465aed27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身披神圣意志与浩瀚恩泽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "889189408428562662d1bcd35deaad05043ba3860c05df69082ef391b2d6e8c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a9b9963078fd034f13baa9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "裙子上起褶子了……祈祷得太久了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a70e0d302eccc9767c403dd75e293ae3cd0a65f23e369321752b4c927b4f25cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79df495db20f23a44e3bad75",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以曼妙舞步，净化人们的心灵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01f11205a2820f44eb42d9db0483b0124d72cc4029f2d96d689ec43f25732b2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9f861302de0f0ec5d29bf6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "束起光芒的纯白缎带……真可爱♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b8e22db97f97408be22ec8165c23ce7ff78098350ded47214e19dd7aad7ab7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60b191a2a98880fecb4645f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "志愿奉仕活动似乎会变得很有趣呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f358aef3577dc78d7f9e1a91f308865baa5e62af014ec022db9028ba1abe2dcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a15f08c40338b8dff1855ab5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，看来精灵也很中意呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14f8a28fba13d20e69667cbb52324bfc4b0ad12e0e6c036899998129e4c4a51b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40e5d403166386261feeb2c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:353d55bc127360972ad82916",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘘……听到了。那试图唤醒我的\r\n崇高之声。\r\n这声是，喔……喔……喔喔喔——？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c3f1d519013608fbe3d5a98050241fc28a965f57e8531b3742f10e29b2a168c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05d4701b381ef3b874f660b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊……啊，抱歉！昨晚\r\n不小心看异世界转生小说太入迷了……\r\n没想到勇者竟然是亲姐姐……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e022485335d580dfc68c13f656cf55393e9f56b86b3dabc20dfd107c2d0dcf6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:467a860b123b9168b1647f2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迎接试炼的良机到来了。\r\n来吧！今天在食堂\r\n要挑战几级辣度的咖喱呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "853c74c292be33c29870a161a49f25a94a33ba60b36ca4d303c00da9e729cdfb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ad1720b263d4f099cc46197",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀……呵呵。方才得到的神谕说\r\n能遇上贵人。\r\n果然应验了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "942338f7d6933d3c414b43fc5aeb4cd2289b63b093dab6f138fed3b35e5584b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb415dba086f656e8746fdfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "暗夜令人无助，徒增不安……\r\n您什么都不必说，没关系的。\r\n就由我的光芒来温暖您吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea795f2e0f9cec1d3011af87d54a4132a13cb54e43c1792d3fb623d1bf0c09e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42c1e823ffef81c2ff1fecb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我悄悄溜出房间，向繁星祈祷着。\r\n愿爱律同学能够在目标赛事中\r\n如愿以偿……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a52b6efd91434373a8cb095cd47fffb5253cb46400e594230d33ccafa85acbf1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca82a7b241d4f690475c72e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天是新作迭出的季节。小说、漫画、\r\n动画……净是些精彩的转生故事，\r\n教人哪还有空闲去睡春觉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c046e594d41b68a1c479fe760259e5414cc3adfb11fb6608f6499d0d9513974f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50f0f8d12da13d87e4d441da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "酷暑连绵不绝呢……不，这亦是\n一种试炼！是降下神旨命我\n平息烈日的狂暴……包在我身上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b8d0e50a2c06742fcd14abdc262ba5b997a24ec7439f97920d2b464db643308",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b203bb9fe13aa9f9801d1588",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啦～噜啦啦啦～～…♪呵呵呵，\r\n以虫鸣为伴奏哼唱赞歌。\r\n欢快的时节终于到来了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9260ae5c3f933bc479cdd8cb3d482b3e2a52e3a592935cd6c233f92c4c233999",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ca09eb300e15c6067066a27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请用这杯肉桂满满的咖啡，\r\n温暖您的身与心吧。\r\n由咖啡同学亲传，味道绝对有保证♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8254b4151f4f59e157a99d1cb7fb5849e65ce30faf0a313db231363b2fa86ca7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab494d6bbea9b5e6ca3207cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "献上情人节的祝福……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a811bf2dcf3467605c3f07321bea57bc2fabfe202f9a207f2f76eb48558addaa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1479e2f6809840a62e445377",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "数学补习的参加者只有我一人……正是\r\n深入潜心求学的好机会！\r\n这份启示，我必好好加以活用！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29b4b47fff7de118e6833f537d5908614c068a0c5d34a597e4ead825fbbdefb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a636c039261b3b05db800bb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向景致同学安利转生题材大获成功。\n她似乎格外中意心动恋爱向……\n必须尽快借给她看才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "252a0b25a788c2d0d15f27f52e577b2966de8966654d91b428b886744f5bfcdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e605efd07c967e441f51f80f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就连指尖的动作，拉拉同学的一举一动\n都有如圣女般优雅美丽……太棒了！\n真希望能向她请教一番。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c01efff491ee2b6acc77ad923a3b30fe9ad6704f24ed351cc5f823d2d39d528e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d43fa65c5bf2cdff55558d8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊～～……穿BDC决胜服的\r\n伏特加，真是令人大饱眼福啊……\r\n感谢这番天赐之福！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b876ab9d3b64c798648b8c4a9912c9512dde3932060c8a434b25c820ada79b44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:639c037afa37f6a4c6821a4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "声线与咖啡中透出的，茶座同学那份\n温柔的深邃……我也想学会呢。\n首先……要从获取咖啡豆的知识开始吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8aadd6c3fe7a3ef4dc228272047155c85a3ba95134a1f163b6e193b4d673d4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:098eba2bc24ad5891e73df95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……轻触项圈，\r\n然后变出星之法杖，这样如何呢？\r\n嗯，作为圣女专属定制去提交申请吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e45f4189d7266059fd3ab20cb05823d16b161e9ec169834cf509630ef63ea76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13073d4b58f61775c40376bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在前几天的演出中，后排右侧的那位观众\r\n面带郁色呢……我必须刻苦钻研，\r\n为大家带来治愈的时光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae944edbd6923b3d13f94770966db5517bfead775501f7480cf2cf1304b01664",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:838b0c8872faaf97cb26f744",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "决胜服的赤红，代表着耐受灼身业火的\r\n坚韧意志……无论多么残酷的\r\n试炼，我都绝不屈服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3bf947c1a63283797c9a23eb2a09dda6cb1dce05906f931eac2310d36c32cc95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9436ba52bb51f18f10c36851",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晴朗的夜晚，我便身着这身衣裳在天台\r\n献上祈祷。为了吸纳星辰之力，\r\n备战赛事……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c1c3e2c06f5adb1e25f549cb495020027f6f8a725fba09b5f28dd4d6c800402",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:affb51efbfea9aabbb049235",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心中想着对方的笑颜……这是景致同学\n教我的便当制作秘诀。\n我这就去志愿奉仕活动中分给大家品尝♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "821565e638fa17ccfe3265cc5b2f23d6b0fd17ced3c82c08f7a8cfe1d1493bd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cf196027497ecbcf4d0d519",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给创升同学带的点心，\n就决定是限量版巧克力了……这样\n才配得上伏特加的新情报嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cad43cab20e4828cf37c7f65a61fe43390f20533433bf7cd3e8393648163f3be",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "91010"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
